DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
32128::$$$message_0254_0000_0000$$$::We'll cross the bridge into Shinto.[lr]::
32129::$$$message_0254_0000_0001$$$::Nobody uses the pedestrian walkway at this time of night.[lr]::
32130::$$$message_0254_0000_0002$$$::There aren't any cars tonight, either. I can clearly hear the sea breeze.::
32131::$$$message_0254_0001_0000$$$::"This takes me back. Remember that time we walked to the church together?"::
32132::$$$message_0254_0002_0000$$$::"Yes. You still didn't know what it meant to be a Master, I hadn't quite accepted being your Servant, and Rin was still our enemy.[lr]::
32133::$$$message_0254_0002_0001$$$::In hindsight, we made an odd trio indeed."::
32134::$$$message_0254_0003_0000$$$::Saber chuckles.[lr]::
32135::$$$message_0254_0003_0001$$$::Like me, she seems to look back fondly on what happened half a year ago.[lr]::
32136::$$$message_0254_0003_0002$$$::I still remember it well, and I always will.[lr]::
32137::$$$message_0254_0003_0003$$$::That night was special.[lr]::
32138::$$$message_0254_0003_0004$$$::Of course, all the time I spent with Saber during the war was special, but everything began that night.::
32139::$$$message_0254_0004_0000$$$::"You were pretty grumpy at first.[lr]::
32140::$$$message_0254_0004_0001$$$::We didn't have much chance to talk that night, but you were completely silent on the way to the church."::
32141::$$$message_0254_0005_0000$$$::"I had reason to be upset. I can say this now, but I was angry at the way you treated me.[lr]::
32142::$$$message_0254_0005_0001$$$::Surely there was a better way to disguise me!"::
32143::$$$message_0254_0006_0000$$$::Oh. She didn't like the yellow raincoat, huh?[lr]::
32144::$$$message_0254_0006_0001$$$::I see her wearing the raincoat pretty often, despite that. Maybe it's her way of getting back at me.::
32145::$$$message_0254_0007_0000$$$::"Mrgh. You look like you have something to say. [wvl][move textoff=0 both=1 opacity=0 base=027_アチャ光点 cx=55 storage=027_アチャ光点 py=180 px=275 affine=(275,180,-45,0.5,55,55,55)(275,180,-90,0.6,155,55,55)(275,180,-135,0.7,0,55,55)(275,180,-180,0.7,200,55,55)(275,180,-225,0.7,155,55,55) time=1200 cy=55 mag=0.4 deg=+0.0 accel=-2]Very well. Let us settle the matter here, and I expect your apology for[line len=2][cacheimage storage=セイバー鎧08a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=セイバー鎧08a(中)]Shirou!"[wm canskip=0]::
32146::$$$message_0254_0008_0000$$$::"Wha[line len=2]"[lr]::
32147::$$$message_0254_0008_0001$$$::Saber blocks a bolt of light with her sword.[lr]::
32148::$$$message_0254_0008_0002$$$::The shockwave sends shudders through the bridge supports.::
32149::$$$message_0254_0009_0000$$$::"Get back! An enemy Servant is attacking...!"[lr]::
32150::$$$message_0254_0009_0001$$$::A second attack...![lr]::
32151::$$$message_0254_0009_0002$$$::I can't figure out exactly what's happening.[lr]::
32152::$$$message_0254_0009_0003$$$::Saber stands in front of me, repelling bolts of light with her sword.::
32153::$$$message_0254_0010_0000$$$::"An enemy Servant!?[lr]::
32154::$$$message_0254_0010_0001$$$::Damn, who? Where!?"[lr]::
32155::$$$message_0254_0010_0002$$$::The third attack comes. [lr]::
32156::$$$message_0254_0010_0003$$$::Saber fends it off again.[lr]::
32157::$$$message_0254_0010_0004$$$::...This is bad. They're clearly getting stronger.[lr]::
32158::$$$message_0254_0010_0005$$$::Saber can still block them, but I don't know how long she can hold out if these strikes keep increasing in number and ferocity.::
32159::$$$message_0254_0011_0000$$$::If Saber were alone, she might be able to protect herself long enough to advance on and defeat the attacker.[lr]::
32160::$$$message_0254_0011_0001$$$::But I'm the one being targeted right now.[lr]::
32161::$$$message_0254_0011_0002$$$::The instant Saber leaves my side, those projectiles will hit me.[lr]::
32162::$$$message_0254_0011_0003$$$::She can't advance as long as she has me to worry about.[lr]::
32163::$$$message_0254_0011_0004$$$::No...[lr]::
32164::$$$message_0254_0011_0005$$$::In the worst case, we might not even be able to retreat to Miyama, and she might get hit by the bolts of light and go down because of me...[fg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=0 index=5000 top=0 time=100 storage=red2]::
32165::$$$message_0254_0012_0000$$$::"Shirou, I will block the enemy attacks! Please stay where you are!"[lr]::
32166::$$$message_0254_0012_0001$$$::A fourth attack.[lr]::
32167::$$$message_0254_0012_0002$$$::I can hear the worry in Saber's voice.[lr]::
32168::$$$message_0254_0012_0003$$$::The enemy attacks are focused on me; they know that I'm the weak link. Saber has to force herself on the defensive to cover me.[wm canskip=0]::
32169::$$$message_0254_0013_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
32170::$$$message_0254_0013_0001$$$::...At this rate, Saber will lose.[lr]::
32171::$$$message_0254_0013_0002$$$::It's clear what I have to do.[lr]::
32172::$$$message_0254_0013_0003$$$::Basically, I need to protect myself.[clfg textoff=0 pos=all time=100]::
32173::$$$message_0254_0014_0000$$$::I concentrate my nerves.[lr]::
32174::$$$message_0254_0014_0001$$$::I can see the bolts of light, which means I can defend myself against them.[lr]::
32175::$$$message_0254_0014_0002$$$::In the past, I wouldn't have known what to do.[lr]::
32176::$$$message_0254_0014_0003$$$::But the Shirou Emiya who survived the Holy Grail War has the experience and skill to make it possible.::
32177::$$$message_0254_0015_0000$$$::The fifth and final attack comes.[lr]::
32178::$$$message_0254_0015_0001$$$::"Nngh...!!!"[lr]::
32179::$$$message_0254_0015_0002$$$::Saber is knocked severely off balance.[wdash canskip=0][lr]::
32180::$$$message_0254_0015_0003$$$::...There's no doubt about it.[lr]::
32181::$$$message_0254_0015_0004$$$::These long-range attacks are from a Noble Phantasm.::
32182::$$$message_0254_0016_0000$$$::Even Saber can't block a Noble Phantasm repeatedly.[lr]::
32183::$$$message_0254_0016_0001$$$::If she were on her own, she wouldn't need to bother with defense at all!::
32184::$$$message_0254_0017_0000$$$::"...! Saber, look out!"[lr]::
32185::$$$message_0254_0017_0001$$$::"Kuh! No, Shirou, I can take it...!"[lr]::
32186::$$$message_0254_0017_0002$$$::There's no way she can.[wm canskip=0][lr]::
32187::$$$message_0254_0017_0003$$$::The sixth attack will defeat Saber. That's the only foreseeable outcome with our current tactics.::
32188::$$$message_0254_0018_0000$$$::"Don't underestimate me! I can...!"[lr]::
32189::$$$message_0254_0018_0001$$$::I can protect myself.[lr]::
32190::$$$message_0254_0018_0002$$$::I glare in the direction of the enemy.[clfg textoff=0 time=100 storage=セイバー鎧08b(中)][lr]::
32191::$$$message_0254_0018_0003$$$::A bolt of light hurtles toward me, aimed between my eyes.[lr]::
32192::$$$message_0254_0018_0004$$$::I can see it. So all I need to do is...[lr]::
32193::$$$message_0254_0018_0005$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
32194::$$$message_0254_0018_0006$$$::I completely forgot.[lr]::
32195::$$$message_0254_0018_0007$$$::What am I supposed to do next?::
32196::$$$message_0254_0019_0000$$$::"...!!!"[rf][wm canskip=0][lr]::
32197::$$$message_0254_0019_0001$$$::...I screwed up.[lr]::
32198::$$$message_0254_0019_0002$$$::Did I make some mistake?[lr]::
32199::$$$message_0254_0019_0003$$$::Did I forget, or did I just never know from the start?[lr]::
32200::$$$message_0254_0019_0004$$$::Did I neglect to bring along a fundamental part of Shirou Emiya's abilities?[lr]::
32201::$$$message_0254_0019_0005$$$::If the knowledge was ever there, it's now oozing out of the hole in my forehead.::
32202::$$$message_0254_0020_0000$$$::"                      "[rf]::
32203::$$$message_0254_0021_0000$$$::I can't hear her voice very well.[lr]::
32204::$$$message_0254_0021_0001$$$::I don't know what I was supposed to do, nor what I forgot.[lr]::
32205::$$$message_0254_0021_0002$$$::My consciousness drifts away.[lr]::
32206::$$$message_0254_0021_0003$$$::I've fallen before I could make it to the fourth day.[lr]::
32207::$$$message_0254_0021_0004$$$::I'm lacking something.[lr]::
32208::$$$message_0254_0021_0005$$$::Most likely, I couldn't use it because I never tried it even once, even though I should've known how all along.::
32209::$$$message_0254_0022_0000$$$::Then...where should I have gone to get a better grasp on Shirou Emiya's abilities?::

